config IEP
	tristate "Rockchip IEP v1 image enhancement processor"
	depends on ARCH_ROCKCHIP || COMPILE_TEST
	depends on ROCKCHIP_IOMMU || COMPILE_TEST
	select DMA_SHARED_BUFFER
	help
	  Rockchip Image Enhancement Processor (IEP) v1 found on RK3288,
	  RK3399 and similar SoCs. It provides deinterlacing, denoise,
	  detail enhancement and scaling for YUV video.

	  This driver exposes a /dev/iep misc device; the userspace IEP
	  library speaks a private ioctl ABI to it.
